<attribute name="keyConsiderations" nodeId="2bd41c57">&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Where possible, control the scope of the work by fully leveraging Oracle&apos;s standard (out-of-the-box base)
        functionality and EY&apos;s pre-solutioned assets.
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        During the fit gap workshops, be sure to document any pain points raised by the client so that relevant test cases
        can be drafted to validate the desired functionality.
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</attribute>
